unded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            日本一の桜「弘前城（弘前公園）桜まつり」の見どころは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 約2600本の桜が咲き誇る春の祭典で、桜の花びらが外堀を埋め尽くす『花筏（はないかだ）』や夜桜ライトアップが息をのむ美しさです。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            世界自然遺産「白神山地 十二湖（じゅうにこ）青池」とは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> まるで青いインクを流し込んだかのように鮮やかなコバルトブルーに輝く湧水池で、透明度9mの底に倒木が沈む幻想的な光景が広がります。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            津軽の郷土料理「けの汁」と「貝焼き味噌（かいやきみそ）」とは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 大根や人参・山菜を細かく刻んで煮込んだ『けの汁』と、大きなホタテの貝殻を鍋代わりにして味噌と卵でとじる『貝焼き味噌』が朝食の定番です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center border-t border-amber-200/60 mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n    <a href=\"/prefectures/aomori/\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-900 underline\">\n      🎌 青森県の厳選特集一覧を見る →\n    </a>\n  </div>\n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">関連記事ナビ</span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">🗺️ 青森県・関連テーマの厳選おすすめ旅行ガイド（弘前・津軽おすすめ宿10選）</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4\">\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900\">💎 おすすめテーマ特集</h4>\n      \n    <a href=\"/posts/kusatsu-all-hotspring-sources-ryokan-hotels-guide\" class=\"block p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-amber-50 border border-stone-200 text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700 transition\">\n      👉 草津温泉 奈良屋・草津温泉 望雲など楽天トラベル高評価の名宿を徹底比較\n    </a>\n  \n\n    <a href=\"/posts/sunset-ocean-view-coastal-onsen-hotels-guide\" class=\"block p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-amber-50 border border-stone-200 text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700 transition\">\n      👉 堂ヶ島温泉 堂ヶ島ニュー銀水・夕日ヶ浦温泉 時季を彩る 佳松苑など楽天トラベル高評価の名宿を徹底比較\n    </a>\n  \n\n    <a href=\"/posts/mineral-mud-pack-beauty-skin-onsen-hotels-guide\" class=\"block p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-amber-50 border border-stone-200 text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700 transition\">\n      👉 別府明礬温泉 岡本屋旅館・湯けむりとにごり湯の宿 霧島国際ホテルなど楽天トラベル高評価の名宿を徹底比較\n    </a>\n  \n\n    <a href=\"/posts/fuji-view-luxury-onsen-hotels-guide\" class=\"block p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-amber-50 border border-stone-200 text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700 transition\">\n      👉 ふふ 河口湖・庭園と感動の宿 富士山温泉 ホテル鐘山苑 別墅然然など楽天トラベル高評価の名宿を徹底比較\n    </a>\n  \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border